{
  "id": 275103117,
  "slug": "hhr0liyp3tqmkokx",
  "title": "PDF 处理流程说明",
  "book_id": 78815357,
  "format": "lake",
  "status": 1,
  "word_count": 972,
  "created_at": "2026-06-24T15:32:12.000Z",
  "updated_at": "2026-07-17T08:15:41.000Z",
  "published_at": "2026-06-30T02:25:32.000Z",
  "content_updated_at": "2026-06-30T02:25:32.000Z",
  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><h2 data-lake-id=\"sllGZ\" id=\"sllGZ\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue7e596d0\" id=\"ue7e596d0\">1. 功能目标</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u0236ec34\" id=\"u0236ec34\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9795818a\" id=\"u9795818a\">PDF 处理能力的目标是让用户可以直接上传 PDF 文件，并把其中可提取的文本转成 RAG 可处理的知识内容。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u50f2c417\" id=\"u50f2c417\"><span data-lake-id=\"u99137bcc\" id=\"u99137bcc\">在这个提交之前，上传内容更偏向纯文本；这个提交之后，系统可以识别 PDF、解析 PDF 字节、提取正文、切分成 chunk，并尝试进入混合检索索引。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"SfwkJ\" id=\"SfwkJ\"><span data-lake-id=\"u372bdd4e\" id=\"u372bdd4e\">2. 当前已实现能力</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u67b2d4f1\" id=\"u67b2d4f1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue5a1bf01\" id=\"ue5a1bf01\">当前已经实现：</span></p><ul list=\"u6474f16c\"><li fid=\"ue789d41e\" data-lake-id=\"u16a472b0\" id=\"u16a472b0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6dff7dce\" id=\"u6dff7dce\">前端使用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ub3c489ce\" id=\"ub3c489ce\"><span data-lake-id=\"u55661a67\" id=\"u55661a67\">multipart/form-data</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua45f4b7e\" id=\"ua45f4b7e\"> 上传原始文件</span></li><li fid=\"ue789d41e\" data-lake-id=\"u13363ce2\" id=\"u13363ce2\"><code data-lake-id=\"u4131bf76\" id=\"u4131bf76\"><span data-lake-id=\"u49ce4ef8\" id=\"u49ce4ef8\">/api/upload</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc80ea466\" id=\"uc80ea466\"> 支持真实文件上传，同时保留旧版 JSON 文本上传兼容</span></li><li fid=\"ue789d41e\" data-lake-id=\"u05cb2de2\" id=\"u05cb2de2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4335dfc6\" id=\"u4335dfc6\">服务端可以识别 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ua834a2b1\" id=\"ua834a2b1\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud0af709b\" id=\"ud0af709b\">.pdf</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u194aea83\" id=\"u194aea83\"> 文件和 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u2b31b646\" id=\"u2b31b646\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8e98afa6\" id=\"u8e98afa6\">application/pdf</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u428feb0d\" id=\"u428feb0d\"> 类型</span></li><li fid=\"ue789d41e\" data-lake-id=\"ua467c070\" id=\"ua467c070\"><span data-lake-id=\"u605ce663\" id=\"u605ce663\">PDF 不再按普通 UTF-8 文本读取，而是走专门的 PDF 解析流程</span></li><li fid=\"ue789d41e\" data-lake-id=\"uf23cd77d\" id=\"uf23cd77d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ued33260f\" id=\"ued33260f\">PDF 文本提取优先级为：</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u6474f16c\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u4141de84\" data-lake-id=\"ua5915046\" id=\"ua5915046\"><code data-lake-id=\"u2db4f278\" id=\"u2db4f278\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf0622356\" id=\"uf0622356\">pdfplumber</span></code></li><li fid=\"u4141de84\" data-lake-id=\"ufaf7a588\" id=\"ufaf7a588\"><code data-lake-id=\"u2c602d7c\" id=\"u2c602d7c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua120d1ce\" id=\"ua120d1ce\">pdftotext</span></code></li></ul><ul list=\"u6474f16c\" start=\"6\"><li fid=\"ue789d41e\" data-lake-id=\"u05849aff\" id=\"u05849aff\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucf656f93\" id=\"ucf656f93\">解析出的文本会进行归一化，减少 PDF 排版噪声</span></li><li fid=\"ue789d41e\" data-lake-id=\"u2c3060ac\" id=\"u2c3060ac\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1c4b3637\" id=\"u1c4b3637\">文本会进入 RAG 的父子 chunk 切分流程</span></li><li fid=\"ue789d41e\" data-lake-id=\"u27fd3ba4\" id=\"u27fd3ba4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u04bd4380\" id=\"u04bd4380\">上传响应会返回解析器、页数、文本字符数、chunk 数、索引数、</span><code data-lake-id=\"uc3c2008a\" id=\"uc3c2008a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u19041ac3\" id=\"u19041ac3\">doc_hash</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ue2602aad\" id=\"ue2602aad\"> 等信息</span></li><li fid=\"ue789d41e\" data-lake-id=\"u8091f1d1\" id=\"u8091f1d1\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf75769f9\" id=\"uf75769f9\">如果 PDF 可提取文本太少，会返回 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u16f0c4a6\" id=\"u16f0c4a6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucb46ca40\" id=\"ucb46ca40\">needs_ocr: true</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub68b00c4\" id=\"ub68b00c4\">，避免把扫描版 PDF 当作有效知识入库</span></li><li fid=\"ue789d41e\" data-lake-id=\"ud15f498e\" id=\"ud15f498e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2e66f45c\" id=\"u2e66f45c\">PostgreSQL 不可用时，会跳过实际索引和 embedding 调用，避免无效写入</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id=\"zex1D\" id=\"zex1D\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufd68a88c\" id=\"ufd68a88c\">3.PDF 解析策略</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uc11e49bd\" id=\"uc11e49bd\"><span data-lake-id=\"u32831fa1\" id=\"u32831fa1\">系统通过两个信号判断文件是否是 PDF：</span></p><ul list=\"u792be215\"><li fid=\"u7b5cbbf9\" data-lake-id=\"u14d1a348\" id=\"u14d1a348\"><code data-lake-id=\"u55d91947\" id=\"u55d91947\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7ac03280\" id=\"u7ac03280\">Content-Type</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u637d6156\" id=\"u637d6156\"> 是 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u3613fcda\" id=\"u3613fcda\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4e353b95\" id=\"u4e353b95\">application/pdf</span></code></li><li fid=\"u7b5cbbf9\" data-lake-id=\"ud8ec483f\" id=\"ud8ec483f\"><span data-lake-id=\"uecdcd8d3\" id=\"uecdcd8d3\">文件扩展名是 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u648ad64e\" id=\"u648ad64e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u123bb571\" id=\"u123bb571\">.pdf</span></code></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u8a484087\" id=\"u8a484087\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud4f2e43f\" id=\"ud4f2e43f\">解析优先级如下：</span></p><ol list=\"u0b72a072\"><li fid=\"uff1d6c30\" data-lake-id=\"u48ec1e38\" id=\"u48ec1e38\"><code data-lake-id=\"u12450270\" id=\"u12450270\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubb82fcd8\" id=\"ubb82fcd8\">pdfplumber</span></code></li></ol><ul list=\"u0b72a072\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"uaf584a9d\" data-lake-id=\"u54b25f46\" id=\"u54b25f46\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2aea8e62\" id=\"u2aea8e62\">通过 Python 执行。</span></li><li fid=\"uaf584a9d\" data-lake-id=\"uec197c70\" id=\"uec197c70\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubdabb799\" id=\"ubdabb799\">会优先查找环境变量指定的 Python：</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u0b72a072\" data-lake-indent=\"2\"><li fid=\"uce2e0311\" data-lake-id=\"u864ebc1a\" id=\"u864ebc1a\"><code data-lake-id=\"ubf89c20d\" id=\"ubf89c20d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u03a41801\" id=\"u03a41801\">PDF_EXTRACT_PYTHON</span></code></li><li fid=\"uce2e0311\" data-lake-id=\"u919eccac\" id=\"u919eccac\"><code data-lake-id=\"u6d171dd4\" id=\"u6d171dd4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9ca92464\" id=\"u9ca92464\">PDF_PYTHON</span></code></li></ul><ul list=\"u0b72a072\" start=\"3\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"uaf584a9d\" data-lake-id=\"ua2562eb1\" id=\"ua2562eb1\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf4fdf353\" id=\"uf4fdf353\">然后查找系统 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u21bdccac\" id=\"u21bdccac\"><span data-lake-id=\"u33bf0deb\" id=\"u33bf0deb\">python3</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u9373ee42\" id=\"u9373ee42\">。</span></li><li fid=\"uaf584a9d\" data-lake-id=\"uda6dd446\" id=\"uda6dd446\"><span data-lake-id=\"u398111d8\" id=\"u398111d8\">会输出类似 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ua4b08d62\" id=\"ua4b08d62\"><span data-lake-id=\"uda0b8dc9\" id=\"uda0b8dc9\">--- page 1 ---</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2ac3eaa4\" id=\"u2ac3eaa4\"> 的页标记。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u0b72a072\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"uff1d6c30\" data-lake-id=\"u28ea80ee\" id=\"u28ea80ee\"><code data-lake-id=\"u56ec31f3\" id=\"u56ec31f3\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf90ea85b\" id=\"uf90ea85b\">pdftotext</span></code></li></ol><ul list=\"u0b72a072\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u59c843f7\" data-lake-id=\"u8a26a32a\" id=\"u8a26a32a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u173b65ad\" id=\"u173b65ad\">如果系统 PATH 中存在 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ua5be9da2\" id=\"ua5be9da2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u11bc9241\" id=\"u11bc9241\">pdftotext</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uba41a586\" id=\"uba41a586\">，会作为第二解析方案。</span></li><li fid=\"u59c843f7\" data-lake-id=\"ud93f8e6e\" id=\"ud93f8e6e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua6683d98\" id=\"ua6683d98\">使用 layout preservation 和 UTF-8 输出。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"u0b72a072\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"uff1d6c30\" data-lake-id=\"uafb64459\" id=\"uafb64459\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8019d8f1\" id=\"u8019d8f1\">Go fallback</span></li></ol><ul list=\"u0b72a072\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u7c2c0000\" data-lake-id=\"u8558c08d\" id=\"u8558c08d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u437809de\" id=\"u437809de\">使用 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u82b3b591\" id=\"u82b3b591\"><span data-lake-id=\"ude20bb8d\" id=\"ude20bb8d\">github.com/ledongthuc/pdf</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf10dd372\" id=\"uf10dd372\">​</span></li><li fid=\"u7c2c0000\" data-lake-id=\"u2d6a8ee4\" id=\"u2d6a8ee4\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc11e5856\" id=\"uc11e5856\">先尝试按行提取，再退回普通文本提取。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u6688c9ff\" id=\"u6688c9ff\"><span data-lake-id=\"u529ffd2b\" id=\"u529ffd2b\">如果所有方案都无法提取有效文本，接口会返回需要 OCR 的错误或标记。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"Ci83c\" id=\"Ci83c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u73724b74\" id=\"u73724b74\">5. 文本归一化</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u76d9ba0c\" id=\"u76d9ba0c\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf53fc25a\" id=\"uf53fc25a\">PDF 提取出的文本通常带有换行、断词、空格和页眉页脚等噪声。当前归一化会处理：</span></p><ul list=\"u45440b0a\"><li fid=\"u9e9e2ec7\" data-lake-id=\"u1660655e\" id=\"u1660655e\"><code data-lake-id=\"u9bd87646\" id=\"u9bd87646\"><span data-lake-id=\"u33e01ffb\" id=\"u33e01ffb\">\\r\\n</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua418dc54\" id=\"ua418dc54\"> 和 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u412e026d\" id=\"u412e026d\"><span data-lake-id=\"uec486649\" id=\"uec486649\">\\r</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf01caa0a\" id=\"uf01caa0a\"> 统一为 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u5867732b\" id=\"u5867732b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u00c94569\" id=\"u00c94569\">\\n</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uf32628c0\" id=\"uf32628c0\">​</span></li><li fid=\"u9e9e2ec7\" data-lake-id=\"u648a0cb0\" id=\"u648a0cb0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u86bec457\" id=\"u86bec457\">移除空字节和软连字符。</span></li><li fid=\"u9e9e2ec7\" data-lake-id=\"ube7ba5c9\" id=\"ube7ba5c9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2bfb19d8\" id=\"u2bfb19d8\">修复英文断行连字符，例如 </span><code data-lake-id=\"uf49b0029\" id=\"uf49b0029\"><span data-lake-id=\"u160be2bb\" id=\"u160be2bb\">RE-\\nWARDS</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua2dabda7\" id=\"ua2dabda7\">​</span></li><li fid=\"u9e9e2ec7\" data-lake-id=\"u99800e70\" id=\"u99800e70\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue802a7fe\" id=\"ue802a7fe\">合并重复空格和 tab。</span></li><li fid=\"u9e9e2ec7\" data-lake-id=\"u13d5d29c\" id=\"u13d5d29c\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc22cdb1c\" id=\"uc22cdb1c\">压缩过多空行。</span></li><li fid=\"u9e9e2ec7\" data-lake-id=\"u69996c67\" id=\"u69996c67\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9df96f3f\" id=\"u9df96f3f\">去掉首尾空白。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"u40567b16\" id=\"u40567b16\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5f1b57b7\" id=\"u5f1b57b7\">这样可以减少无意义 chunk，提高后续检索质量。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"zrYJX\" id=\"zrYJX\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7fbe9ef9\" id=\"u7fbe9ef9\">6. RAG 切分方式</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uceeba8f9\" id=\"uceeba8f9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8dae2069\" id=\"u8dae2069\">PDF 文本进入 RAG 后使用 small-to-big chunking：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22latex%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%96%87%E6%A1%A3%E6%96%87%E6%9C%AC%5Cn%20%20%7C%5Cn%20%20v%5Cn%E7%88%B6%20chunk%20%E5%88%87%E5%88%86%5Cn%20%20-%20size%3A%20max(rag.chunk_size%20*%204%2C%20600)%5Cn%20%20-%20overlap%3A%20rag.chunk_overlap%20*%202%5Cn%20%20%7C%5Cn%20%20v%5Cn%E5%AD%90%20chunk%20%E5%88%87%E5%88%86%5Cn%20%20-%20size%3A%20rag.chunk_size%5Cn%20%20-%20overlap%3A%20rag.chunk_overlap%5Cn%20%20%7C%5Cn%20%20v%5Cn%E7%B4%A2%E5%BC%95%E5%AD%90%20chunk%EF%BC%8C%E5%B9%B6%E4%BF%9D%E7%95%99%E7%88%B6%20chunk%20%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%87%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eafpu%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u900a0983\" id=\"u900a0983\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8756a543\" id=\"u8756a543\">当前默认配置：</span></p><ul list=\"ua9ddf09d\"><li fid=\"u416a494e\" data-lake-id=\"u4c6b9d4e\" id=\"u4c6b9d4e\"><code data-lake-id=\"ud69f695c\" id=\"ud69f695c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3f53b567\" id=\"u3f53b567\">rag.chunk_size = 200</span></code></li><li fid=\"u416a494e\" data-lake-id=\"ude90cb47\" id=\"ude90cb47\"><code data-lake-id=\"ud2ecc046\" id=\"ud2ecc046\"><span data-lake-id=\"u07369055\" id=\"u07369055\">rag.chunk_overlap = 50</span></code></li><li fid=\"u416a494e\" data-lake-id=\"u3b9eae2e\" id=\"u3b9eae2e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u152d940f\" id=\"u152d940f\">父 chunk 大小约 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u02914a82\" id=\"u02914a82\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6a0de303\" id=\"u6a0de303\">800</span></code></li><li fid=\"u416a494e\" data-lake-id=\"u355339ad\" id=\"u355339ad\"><span data-lake-id=\"udee04c20\" id=\"udee04c20\">父 chunk overlap 为 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u12ea761a\" id=\"u12ea761a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua88435ca\" id=\"ua88435ca\">100</span></code></li><li fid=\"u416a494e\" data-lake-id=\"u9f0b858f\" id=\"u9f0b858f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubeac0005\" id=\"ubeac0005\">子 chunk 大小为 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u71142993\" id=\"u71142993\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue82c57fe\" id=\"ue82c57fe\">200</span></code></li><li fid=\"u416a494e\" data-lake-id=\"ua061af5a\" id=\"ua061af5a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud2ccfa8d\" id=\"ud2ccfa8d\">子 chunk overlap 为 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u6a17cbb6\" id=\"u6a17cbb6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u50f30804\" id=\"u50f30804\">50</span></code></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"udd9183a0\" id=\"udd9183a0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4355630c\" id=\"u4355630c\">检索时先命中更精准的子 chunk，再扩展到更大的父 chunk 给 LLM 使用。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"BLeGX\" id=\"BLeGX\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua9cbc687\" id=\"ua9cbc687\">7. 索引语义</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u0f9a81d3\" id=\"u0f9a81d3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9924e1ee\" id=\"u9924e1ee\">当前混合索引顺序是：</span></p><ol list=\"ud2246cbb\"><li fid=\"u1cef3e9f\" data-lake-id=\"uba3821a8\" id=\"uba3821a8\"><span data-lake-id=\"uad4d001d\" id=\"uad4d001d\">检查 PostgreSQL 是否可用。</span></li><li fid=\"u1cef3e9f\" data-lake-id=\"u18b8e63d\" id=\"u18b8e63d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u06928dc3\" id=\"u06928dc3\">如果 PostgreSQL 不可用：</span></li></ol><ul list=\"ud2246cbb\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"uff7acb7f\" data-lake-id=\"u4003be14\" id=\"u4003be14\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0f56b214\" id=\"u0f56b214\">返回已计算的 </span><code data-lake-id=\"ueb0fe375\" id=\"ueb0fe375\"><span data-lake-id=\"udda0360b\" id=\"udda0360b\">doc_hash</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua0e3ae41\" id=\"ua0e3ae41\">​</span></li><li fid=\"uff7acb7f\" data-lake-id=\"uff85a598\" id=\"uff85a598\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf3174d21\" id=\"uf3174d21\">返回 chunk 数。</span></li><li fid=\"uff7acb7f\" data-lake-id=\"u6e963545\" id=\"u6e963545\"><code data-lake-id=\"u69ee162a\" id=\"u69ee162a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u15661613\" id=\"u15661613\">indexed_count = 0</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u58b14e4c\" id=\"u58b14e4c\">​</span></li><li fid=\"uff7acb7f\" data-lake-id=\"u858fb7cc\" id=\"u858fb7cc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u67e0b17d\" id=\"u67e0b17d\">跳过 embedding。</span></li><li fid=\"uff7acb7f\" data-lake-id=\"u13d95082\" id=\"u13d95082\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub869d8ec\" id=\"ub869d8ec\">跳过 Milvus / Elasticsearch / Neo4j 写入。</span></li></ul><ol list=\"ud2246cbb\" start=\"3\"><li fid=\"u1cef3e9f\" data-lake-id=\"ubc27800c\" id=\"ubc27800c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u624ea180\" id=\"u624ea180\">如果 PostgreSQL 可用：</span></li></ol><ul list=\"ud2246cbb\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u1c2831e8\" data-lake-id=\"u187f3e62\" id=\"u187f3e62\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf86c9e82\" id=\"uf86c9e82\">生成 embedding。</span></li><li fid=\"u1c2831e8\" data-lake-id=\"u7018bb0c\" id=\"u7018bb0c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u232166b2\" id=\"u232166b2\">保存 chunk、parent content 和 embedding JSON 到 PG。</span></li><li fid=\"u1c2831e8\" data-lake-id=\"u27559710\" id=\"u27559710\"><span data-lake-id=\"u44ec88b8\" id=\"u44ec88b8\">可用时写入 Milvus。</span></li><li fid=\"u1c2831e8\" data-lake-id=\"u8ffb0d1b\" id=\"u8ffb0d1b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubbf14cf1\" id=\"ubbf14cf1\">可用时写入 Elasticsearch。</span></li><li fid=\"u1c2831e8\" data-lake-id=\"u53665bf0\" id=\"u53665bf0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3b927efc\" id=\"u3b927efc\">可用时异步触发 Neo4j 知识图谱索引。</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"ud58346b1\" id=\"ud58346b1\"><code data-lake-id=\"ua6401ff8\" id=\"ua6401ff8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u384d5996\" id=\"u384d5996\">Engine.Loaded</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ub7d28d62\" id=\"ub7d28d62\"> 现在由实际成功索引数量决定。也就是说，PDF 解析成功但索引失败时，不会误报 RAG 已加载。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"gL8nC\" id=\"gL8nC\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub9f50fb3\" id=\"ub9f50fb3\">8. 上传响应示例</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ud4a23abb\" id=\"ud4a23abb\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf9a0419e\" id=\"uf9a0419e\">成功上传并解析后，响应类似：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22json%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B%5Cn%20%20%5C%22filename%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22paper.pdf%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22content_type%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22application%2Fpdf%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22parser%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22pdfplumber%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22pages%5C%22%3A%2022%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22text_chars%5C%22%3A%2076642%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22needs_ocr%5C%22%3A%20false%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22chunk_count%5C%22%3A%20539%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22parent_count%5C%22%3A%20102%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22indexed_count%5C%22%3A%200%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22chunk_preview%5C%22%3A%20%5B%5D%2C%5Cn%20%20%5C%22doc_hash%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22sha256...%5C%22%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bck6q%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ud533921f\" id=\"ud533921f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8680da24\" id=\"u8680da24\">如果 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u0a7b991d\" id=\"u0a7b991d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1f1ca6a1\" id=\"u1f1ca6a1\">needs_ocr = true</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u0035dbe7\" id=\"u0035dbe7\">，说明该 PDF 可能是扫描版或图片型 PDF，当前不会进入 RAG。</span></p>",
